(7326016, 1142983, 142425, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by markwiley:</b></div><hr/><i> While this fits the challenge the image could be a bit more compelling. Perhaps a lower, closer shot of the crocus blooms with the dappled light stretching into the background would have made for a more interesting image. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I disagree. A lower viewpoint would have foreshortened the shadow to light transitions and produced an indistinguishable blob. This viewpoint maintains the integrity of ''dappled light''.</td>', 'Originally posted by markwiley: While this fits the challenge the image could be a bit more compelling. Perhaps a lower, closer shot of the crocus blooms with the dappled light stretching into the background would have made for a more interesting image.   I disagree. A lower viewpoint would have foreshortened the shadow to light transitions and produced an indistinguishable blob. This viewpoint maintains the integrity of ''dappled light''.', '2015-03-11 03:44:32.000000', NULL, 0),
